  "text_pages": [
    "Exchange/Visiting Pre-Arrival Guide - h. Digital Student ID\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nDigital Student ID\n(Mobile ID)\nMobile ID & Mobile Campus\nYou can find the\nHUFS Mobile ID\napp by searching the App Store or Google Play store for:\n한국외국어대학교 모바일ID\nYou can login using your student ID number and password. Please note that the Mobile ID will not work until\nthe start of the semester. Please access all university information and services via the university website or student services website.\nHUFS Mobile Campus\nDownload the HUFS Mobile Campus app to check out all sorts of information about HUFS from the cafeteria menu, bus schedule between campuses, and even look up professors contact information.\nLogin using your student ID and PW. You can\nswitch the interface language to English\nin the settings menu.\niOS App Store\nhttps://apps.apple.com/ie/app/%ED%95%9C%EA%B5%AD%EC%99%B8%EB%8C%80/id1032310471\nGoogle Play Store\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=kr.ac.hufs.mobilecampus\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nReport abuse"
  ],
